posts.body:
Are you talking about VS plugin? I don't think it should stop/change unless the map autoplays or events that run again try to change it when it reloads when you return from the options scene.
Anyway, would probably be annoying trying to edit that plugin. If you're using it, try making a plugin file and add at the beginning of AudioManager.playBgm and AudioManager.playBgs (or alias them):
if (SceneManager._scene instanceof Scene_EventedTitleMap && AudioManager._doNotPlay) {
return
}
Then in the event that puts you into options menu set
AudioManager._doNotPlay = true;
When you come back set
AudioManager._doNotPlay = false;
EDIT: Or you have to set it to false in your autorun event, as it gets reloaded when you return from the options scene.
EDIT2: Or depending how it's set up, you might not want to turn it to false at all.
